        "source_solution": "n(n+1)-(2n+1)=109 gives (n-11)(n+10)=0; natural pair 11,12.",
        "unit_reason": "The two numbers are one coherent result from one condition.",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "Recognition of a complete result does not demonstrate independently setting up and writing the solution."
